{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794365443592,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"todowrite","callID":"call-16a6c624-3da3-4ec5-9867-538aca19c3bc","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"todos":[{"status":"in_progress","content":"Set up frontend deps (Tailwind, router) and verify npm registry access","priority":"high"},{"status":"pending","content":"Implement Flask backend: SQLite schema, auth, posts API, admin toggle, static serving","priority":"high"},{"status":"pending","content":"Implement React frontend: auth, post list/filters/paging, post page, editor, admin controls","priority":"high"},{"status":"pending","content":"Build frontend and run end-to-end API verification","priority":"high"}]},"output":"[\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Set up frontend deps (Tailwind, router) and verify npm registry access\",\n    \"status\": \"in_progress\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Implement Flask backend: SQLite schema, auth, posts API, admin toggle, static serving\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Implement React frontend: auth, post list/filters/paging, post page, editor, admin controls\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  },\n  {\n    \"content\": \"Build frontend and run end-to-end API verification\",\n    \"status\": \"pending\",\n    \"priority\": \"high\"\n  }\n]","metadata":{"todos":[{"content":"Set up frontend deps (Tailwind, router) and verify npm registry access","status":"in_progress","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement Flask backend: SQLite schema, auth, posts API, admin toggle, static serving","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Implement React frontend: auth, post list/filters/paging, post page, editor, admin controls","status":"pending","priority":"high"},{"content":"Build frontend and run end-to-end API verification","status":"pending","priority":"high"}],"truncated":false},"title":"4 todos","time":{"start":1794365443558,"end":1794365443562}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c883cddc0010jy2L3AiMtVlWa","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","messageID":"msg_1c883b3fa001Jre5vh9wfPZmOl"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794365443592,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"id":"prt_1c883cdda001vXu8UdYazKAv3L","messageID":"msg_1c883b3fa001Jre5vh9wfPZmOl","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","type":"text","text":"<think>Now let me check whether the frontend can install Tailwind CSS. The task says \"Style the frontend with Tailwind CSS utility classes; avoid hand-written CSS files except for Tailwind's own entry file.\"\n\nTailwind v4 with the Vite plugin is the easiest: `npm install -D tailwindcss @tailwindcss/vite`. Let me check if npm registry works.\n\nAlso I need to update package-lock.json. Let me plan.\n\nLet me set up a todo list first.\n\nPlan:\n1. Backend: Flask app with SQLite storage.\n   - Models: users, posts, post_tags (tags), sessions/tokens\n   - Auth: register, login with Bearer tokens\n   - Admin account `admin` with password from `ADMIN_PASSWORD` env, disabled when unset/empty\n   - Posts: list with filters q, tag, author, page, page_size; create; get; put; delete; admin toggle\n   - Serve frontend dist\n2. Frontend: React + TS + Vite + Tailwind\n   - Pages: home/list, post detail, editor, login/register\n   - Routing: use react-router? Need to add dependency. Or implement simple hash-free routing manually with history API. Let me use react-router-dom for simplicity — need npm install.\n3. Build, test.\n\nLet me check npm install works with tailwind and react-router.\n\nLet me first check the npm registry access.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794365443546,"end":1794365443566}}}
