{"type":"text","timestamp":1794365454239,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"id":"prt_1c883f78d001MmIxP7knlsXrw9","messageID":"msg_1c883e509001408YKJcX3WRCPO","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","type":"text","text":"<think>npm registry works. Now let me plan the dependencies:\n- `tailwindcss` ^4.3.5 + `@tailwindcss/vite` ^4.3.5 (dev deps)\n- `react-router-dom` ^7.18.5\n\nLet me install these.\n\nActually, for routing — do I want react-router? It adds complexity but makes it much cleaner. Let me use it.\n\nLet me install.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794365454221,"end":1794365454236}}}
