{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794365812987,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call-d6a0d46f-2f06-4e51-807d-8384d52b5b55","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/backend/app.py","newString":"    user = require_user()\n    data = body_json()\n    title, content, tags = validate_post_payload(data)","oldString":"    user = require_user()\n    data = body_json()\n    title, content, tags = validate_post_payload(data, require_all=False)","replaceAll":false},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/backend/app.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/backend/app.py\n+++ /workspace/backend/app.py\n@@ -463,9 +463,9 @@\n @app.post(\"/api/posts\")\n def create_post():\n     user = require_user()\n     data = body_json()\n-    title, content, tags = validate_post_payload(data, require_all=False)\n+    title, content, tags = validate_post_payload(data)\n \n     connection = get_db()\n     timestamp = to_iso(utc_now())\n     cursor = connection.execute(\n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/backend/app.py","patch":"Index: /workspace/backend/app.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/backend/app.py\n+++ /workspace/backend/app.py\n@@ -463,9 +463,9 @@\n @app.post(\"/api/posts\")\n def create_post():\n     user = require_user()\n     data = body_json()\n-    title, content, tags = validate_post_payload(data, require_all=False)\n+    title, content, tags = validate_post_payload(data)\n \n     connection = get_db()\n     timestamp = to_iso(utc_now())\n     cursor = connection.execute(\n","additions":1,"deletions":1},"truncated":false},"title":"backend/app.py","time":{"start":1794365812954,"end":1794365812965}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c88970d4001ALZDLBW90RBx96","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","messageID":"msg_1c8896795001pZlObI05Q0BQo4"}}
