{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794365822873,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"id":"prt_1c8899786001z9aZcSddOP5sWi","messageID":"msg_1c88970f5001Th4pjgARm5IXxY","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794365822873,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"id":"prt_1c8899789001jRciAwWhZ9CzaD","messageID":"msg_1c88970f5001Th4pjgARm5IXxY","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","type":"text","text":"<think>Now let me write a quick test script to verify the API. But first, let me check the app imports and runs.\n\nAlso I realize there's a potential issue with `handle_not_found` for non-API paths: it calls send_from_directory(DIST, \"index.html\") — if DIST doesn't exist, Flask raises NotFound → recursion? Flask's error handler raising NotFound inside a 404 handler could loop. Let me guard: if the file doesn't exist, return a plain text response.\n\nActually `send_from_directory` raises NotFound if the file is missing → the error handler for 404 would be invoked again → infinite recursion? Flask catches exceptions raised in error handlers and re-raises them. To be safe, check `if (DIST / \"index.html\").is_file()` else return a simple string.\n\nLet me add a helper `serve_index()`.\n\nAlso the `frontend` catch-all calls send_from_directory(DIST, \"index.html\") — same concern if dist is missing (e.g., backend-only runs). Let me handle it.\n\nLet me add:\n\n```python\ndef serve_index():\n    index = DIST / \"index.html\"\n    if index.is_file():\n        return send_from_directory(DIST, \"index.html\")\n    return (\"Frontend build not found. Run `npm run build` in frontend/.\", 503)\n```\n\nHmm, returning a 503 for the root when the frontend isn't built. In the Docker image the frontend is always built. For local dev it's a helpful message.\n\nLet me apply this.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794365822857,"end":1794365822870}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794365822904,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"edit","callID":"call-abb72fef-b326-493a-a38e-457630d7dd6f","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"filePath":"/workspace/backend/app.py","newString":"def error_response(message: str, status: int):\n    \"\"\"Build the JSON body used for every error.\"\"\"\n    return jsonify({\"error\": message, \"message\": message}), status\n\n\ndef serve_index():\n    \"\"\"Serve the single page application entry point.\"\"\"\n    if (DIST / \"index.html\").is_file():\n        return send_from_directory(DIST, \"index.html\")\n    return \"Frontend build missing. Run `npm run build` inside frontend/.\", 503","oldString":"def error_response(message: str, status: int):\n    \"\"\"Build the JSON body used for every error.\"\"\"\n    return jsonify({\"error\": message, \"message\": message}), status","replaceAll":false},"output":"Edit applied successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"diff":"Index: /workspace/backend/app.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/backend/app.py\n+++ /workspace/backend/app.py\n@@ -51,8 +51,15 @@\n     \"\"\"Build the JSON body used for every error.\"\"\"\n     return jsonify({\"error\": message, \"message\": message}), status\n \n \n+def serve_index():\n+    \"\"\"Serve the single page application entry point.\"\"\"\n+    if (DIST / \"index.html\").is_file():\n+        return send_from_directory(DIST, \"index.html\")\n+    return \"Frontend build missing. Run `npm run build` inside frontend/.\", 503\n+\n+\n def utc_now() -> datetime:\n     return datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n \n \n","filediff":{"file":"/workspace/backend/app.py","patch":"Index: /workspace/backend/app.py\n===================================================================\n--- /workspace/backend/app.py\n+++ /workspace/backend/app.py\n@@ -51,8 +51,15 @@\n     \"\"\"Build the JSON body used for every error.\"\"\"\n     return jsonify({\"error\": message, \"message\": message}), status\n \n \n+def serve_index():\n+    \"\"\"Serve the single page application entry point.\"\"\"\n+    if (DIST / \"index.html\").is_file():\n+        return send_from_directory(DIST, \"index.html\")\n+    return \"Frontend build missing. Run `npm run build` inside frontend/.\", 503\n+\n+\n def utc_now() -> datetime:\n     return datetime.now(timezone.utc)\n \n \n","additions":7,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"backend/app.py","time":{"start":1794365822867,"end":1794365822884}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c889978d001CQafbf0D0dSDA3","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","messageID":"msg_1c88970f5001Th4pjgARm5IXxY"}}
