{"type":"text","timestamp":1794366156299,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"id":"prt_1c88eadfa001Yb9l6iPAJBJVXd","messageID":"msg_1c88e8df8001pO7Uwm55exeSbf","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","type":"text","text":"<think>Now shared UI helpers: formatting dates, a `TagBadge` component, `Notice`, `Spinner`, `Pagination`.\n\nLet me create `src/components/ui.tsx` with small reusable pieces, or separate files. I'll do:\n- src/components/Layout.tsx — header/nav/footer\n- src/components/PostCard.tsx\n- src/components/TagInput.tsx\n- src/components/Pagination.tsx\n- src/components/Notice.tsx\n- src/lib/format.ts — formatDate\n\nLet me write them.\n\nLayout:\n```tsx\nexport default function Layout({ children }: { children: ReactNode }) {\n  const { user, signOut } = useAuth();\n  ...\n}\n```\n\nHeader:\n- Left: brand \"Inkwell\" link to \"/\"\n- Center/right nav: \"Posts\" link, \"Write\" link (if signed in)\n- Right: if user → username + Sign out; else → Sign in + Register links.\n\nMobile-friendly: use flex-wrap.\n\nLet me write the components.\n\nFor the sign-out button, style as a subtle button.\n\nPostCard props: post, onTagClick?, showAdminControls, onToggle.\n\nLet me write PostCard to include: title (Link), byline (author, date), excerpt, tags. Optional children for actions (admin take down / author edit-delete).\n\nI'll pass an `actions?: ReactNode` prop.\n\nPagination component: props {page, pageSize, total, onChange}. Render \"Previous\", page indicator \"Page X of Y\", \"Next\". Also maybe a small window of page numbers. Let me keep it simple: Previous / \"Page X of Y\" / Next, plus total count.\n\nTagInput: props { tags, onChange, error? }. Input with Enter/comma to add; chips with remove.\n\nNotice: props { kind: \"error\" | \"info\" | \"success\", children }.\n\nLet me write them all.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794366156282,"end":1794366156295}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794366156319,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call-ca3a564f-1b97-4352-be46-404c6e1667b6","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"export function formatDate(value: string): string {\n  const parsed = new Date(value);\n  if (Number.isNaN(parsed.getTime())) return value;\n  return parsed.toLocaleDateString(undefined, {\n    year: \"numeric\",\n    month: \"short\",\n    day: \"numeric\",\n  });\n}\n\nexport function formatDateTime(value: string): string {\n  const parsed = new Date(value);\n  if (Number.isNaN(parsed.getTime())) return value;\n  return parsed.toLocaleString(undefined, {\n    year: \"numeric\",\n    month: \"short\",\n    day: \"numeric\",\n    hour: \"2-digit\",\n    minute: \"2-digit\",\n  });\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/lib/format.ts"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/lib/format.ts","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/lib/format.ts","time":{"start":1794366156291,"end":1794366156302}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c88eadfd0013HYDPq9I8hxaSR","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","messageID":"msg_1c88e8df8001pO7Uwm55exeSbf"}}
