{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794366272847,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"id":"prt_1c890753b001llpCbwHLKcPZtK","messageID":"msg_1c8902ca7001mlwheLzTD2yhZr","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794366272848,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"id":"prt_1c890753d001lOrnw276cLMOih","messageID":"msg_1c8902ca7001mlwheLzTD2yhZr","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the EditorPage.\n\nRoutes: `/new` and `/posts/:id/edit`.\n\n```tsx\nexport default function EditorPage({ mode }: { mode: \"create\" | \"edit\" }) \n```\nOr derive from params. Let me use two components or a single one reading useParams: if params.id exists → edit mode.\n\nI'll write a single EditorPage that checks `useParams().id`.\n\nBehavior:\n- If no user → show a notice \"You need to sign in\" with a link to /login (and redirect automatically?). I'll redirect to /login with a `from` state. Simpler: if not signed in, navigate to /login. Let me show a prompt instead of auto-redirect to avoid surprises; actually auto-redirect is standard. I'll use `<Navigate to=\"/login\" replace />` when the auth loading is done and there's no user.\n\n- Edit mode: fetch post; if error 404 → notice; if post.author !== user.username → notice \"You can only edit your own posts.\"\n\n- Form fields with labels. Submit → create/update.\n\n- Validation messages from the API displayed in a Notice (tone error).\n\n- Delete button in edit mode with confirm.\n\nLet me write it.\n\nNote on the \"showing the API's validation messages\" requirement — the error notice shows `error.message` from ApiError which is the API's error text. Good.\n\nLet me write the EditorPage.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794366272829,"end":1794366272839}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794366272882,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call-bd250e8a-04fb-454e-982b-7c6f40a22baa","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { useCallback, useEffect, useState } from \"react\";\nimport { Link, Navigate, useNavigate, useParams } from \"react-router-dom\";\n\nimport { api, ApiError } from \"../api\";\nimport { useAuth } from \"../auth\";\nimport Layout from \"../components/Layout\";\nimport Notice from \"../components/Notice\";\nimport TagInput from \"../components/TagInput\";\nimport type { Post } from \"../types\";\n\nexport default function EditorPage() {\n  const { id } = useParams();\n  const editing = id !== undefined;\n  const postId = Number(id);\n  const { user, loading: authLoading } = useAuth();\n  const navigate = useNavigate();\n\n  const [title, setTitle] = useState(\"\");\n  const [content, setContent] = useState(\"\");\n  const [tags, setTags] = useState<string[]>([]);\n  const [post, setPost] = useState<Post | null>(null);\n  const [loading, setLoading] = useState(editing);\n  const [saving, setSaving] = useState(false);\n  const [error, setError] = useState<string | null>(null);\n  const [notice, setNotice] = useState<string | null>(null);\n\n  const load = useCallback(async () => {\n    if (!editing || !Number.isFinite(postId)) return;\n    setLoading(true);\n    try {\n      const data = await api.getPost(postId);\n      setPost(data);\n      setTitle(data.title);\n      setContent(data.content);\n      setTags(data.tags);\n      setError(null);\n    } catch (cause) {\n      setError(cause instanceof ApiError ? cause.message : \"Could not load the post.\");\n    } finally {\n      setLoading(false);\n    }\n  }, [editing, postId]);\n\n  useEffect(() => {\n    void load();\n  }, [load]);\n\n  if (!authLoading && !user) {\n    return <Navigate to=\"/login\" replace />;\n  }\n\n  const ownPost = Boolean(post && user && post.author === user.username);\n  const blocked = editing && post !== null && !ownPost;\n\n  const handleSubmit = async (event: React.FormEvent<HTMLFormElement>) => {\n    event.preventDefault();\n    setSaving(true);\n    setError(null);\n    setNotice(null);\n    try {\n      const payload = { title: title.trim(), content, tags };\n      const saved = editing\n        ? await api.updatePost(postId, payload)\n        : await api.createPost(payload);\n      navigate(`/posts/${saved.id}`);\n    } catch (cause) {\n      setError(cause instanceof ApiError ? cause.message : \"The post could not be saved.\");\n      setSaving(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  const handleDelete = async () => {\n    if (!post) return;\n    if (!window.confirm(`Delete \"${post.title}\"? This cannot be undone.`)) return;\n    setSaving(true);\n    try {\n      await api.deletePost(post.id);\n      navigate(\"/\");\n    } catch (cause) {\n      setError(cause instanceof ApiError ? cause.message : \"The post could not be deleted.\");\n      setSaving(false);\n    }\n  };\n\n  return (\n    <Layout>\n      <div className=\"mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-6\">\n        <div>\n          <Link to=\"/\" className=\"text-sm font-medium text-indigo-600 hover:text-indigo-500\">\n            ← Back to all posts\n          </Link>\n          <h1 className=\"mt-3 text-2xl font-bold tracking-tight text-slate-900\">\n            {editing ? \"Edit post\" : \"Write a new post\"}\n          </h1>\n          <p className=\"mt-1 text-sm text-slate-500\">\n            {editing\n              ? \"Changes are saved to your post and the updated date is refreshed.\"\n              : \"Publish a story for everyone to read. Add a few tags to help readers find it.\"}\n          </p>\n        </div>\n\n        {error ? <Notice tone=\"error\">{error}</Notice> : null}\n        {notice ? <Notice tone=\"success\">{notice}</Notice> : null}\n        {blocked ? (\n          <Notice tone=\"error\">You can only edit your own posts.</Notice>\n        ) : null}\n\n        {loading ? (\n          <p className=\"py-10 text-center text-sm text-slate-500\">Loading post…</p>\n        ) : (\n          <form\n            onSubmit={handleSubmit}\n            className=\"space-y-5 rounded-xl border border-slate-200 bg-white p-6 shadow-sm\"\n          >\n            <div>\n              <label htmlFor=\"title\" className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700\">\n                Title\n              </label>\n              <input\n                id=\"title\"\n                type=\"text\"\n                value={title}\n                onChange={(event) => setTitle(event.target.value)}\n                placeholder=\"A clear, descriptive title\"\n                disabled={blocked}\n                className=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm text-slate-800 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-indigo-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-200 disabled:bg-slate-50\"\n              />\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <label htmlFor=\"content\" className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700\">\n                Content\n              </label>\n              <textarea\n                id=\"content\"\n                value={content}\n                onChange={(event) => setContent(event.target.value)}\n                rows={14}\n                placeholder=\"Write your story…\"\n                disabled={blocked}\n                className=\"mt-1.5 w-full rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-3 py-2 text-sm leading-6 text-slate-800 outline-none transition placeholder:text-slate-400 focus:border-indigo-500 focus:ring-2 focus:ring-indigo-200 disabled:bg-slate-50\"\n              />\n            </div>\n\n            <div>\n              <span className=\"block text-sm font-medium text-slate-700\">Tags</span>\n              <div className=\"mt-1.5\">\n                <TagInput tags={tags} onChange={setTags} />\n              </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div className=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-3 border-t border-slate-200 pt-5\">\n              <button\n                type=\"submit\"\n                disabled={saving || blocked}\n                className=\"rounded-lg bg-indigo-600 px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-white transition hover:bg-indigo-500 disabled:cursor-not-allowed disabled:opacity-50\"\n              >\n                {saving ? \"Saving…\" : editing ? \"Save changes\" : \"Publish post\"}\n              </button>\n              <Link\n                to={editing && post ? `/posts/${post.id}` : \"/\"}\n                className=\"rounded-lg border border-slate-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-slate-700 transition hover:bg-slate-50\"\n              >\n                Cancel\n              </Link>\n              {editing && post && ownPost ? (\n                <button\n                  type=\"button\"\n                  disabled={saving}\n                  onClick={handleDelete}\n                  className=\"ml-auto rounded-lg border border-red-300 bg-white px-4 py-2 text-sm font-medium text-red-700 transition hover:bg-red-50 disabled:opacity-50\"\n                >\n                  Delete post\n                </button>\n              ) : null}\n            </div>\n          </form>\n        )}\n      </div>\n    </Layout>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/pages/EditorPage.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/pages/EditorPage.tsx","exists":false,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/pages/EditorPage.tsx","time":{"start":1794366272836,"end":1794366272864}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c89075400016rfuQ7u2GTYkJL","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","messageID":"msg_1c8902ca7001mlwheLzTD2yhZr"}}
