{"type":"step_start","timestamp":1794366317553,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"id":"prt_1c89123e2001Gj2M7qp1uRXTfE","messageID":"msg_1c890f1c7001yw4MLycQy4t6MQ","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","type":"step-start"}}
{"type":"text","timestamp":1794366317553,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"id":"prt_1c89123e5001ltSh0vgqiFNsuJ","messageID":"msg_1c890f1c7001yw4MLycQy4t6MQ","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","type":"text","text":"<think>Now the App.tsx with routes and main.tsx.\n\nApp.tsx:\n```tsx\nimport { Route, Routes } from \"react-router-dom\";\nimport EditorPage from \"./pages/EditorPage\";\nimport HomePage from \"./pages/HomePage\";\nimport LoginPage from \"./pages/LoginPage\";\nimport NotFoundPage from \"./pages/NotFoundPage\";\nimport PostPage from \"./pages/PostPage\";\nimport RegisterPage from \"./pages/RegisterPage\";\n\nexport default function App() {\n  return (\n    <Routes>\n      <Route path=\"/\" element={<HomePage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/posts/:id\" element={<PostPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/posts/:id/edit\" element={<EditorPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/new\" element={<EditorPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/login\" element={<LoginPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/register\" element={<RegisterPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"*\" element={<NotFoundPage />} />\n    </Routes>\n  );\n}\n```\n\nmain.tsx:\n```tsx\nimport { StrictMode } from \"react\";\nimport { createRoot } from \"react-dom/client\";\nimport { BrowserRouter } from \"react-router-dom\";\n\nimport App from \"./App\";\nimport { AuthProvider } from \"./auth\";\nimport \"./index.css\";\n\ncreateRoot(document.getElementById(\"root\")!).render(\n  <StrictMode>\n    <BrowserRouter>\n      <AuthProvider>\n        <App />\n      </AuthProvider>\n    </BrowserRouter>\n  </StrictMode>,\n);\n```\n\nCareful with StrictMode double-effect in dev: the auth effect will run twice; with the cancellation flag it's fine.\n\nLet me write these.</think>\n\n","time":{"start":1794366317541,"end":1794366317551}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794366317573,"sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"write","callID":"call-66a7028c-1521-4b99-b6c2-77dc53320a5a","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"content":"import { Route, Routes } from \"react-router-dom\";\n\nimport EditorPage from \"./pages/EditorPage\";\nimport HomePage from \"./pages/HomePage\";\nimport LoginPage from \"./pages/LoginPage\";\nimport NotFoundPage from \"./pages/NotFoundPage\";\nimport PostPage from \"./pages/PostPage\";\nimport RegisterPage from \"./pages/RegisterPage\";\n\nexport default function App() {\n  return (\n    <Routes>\n      <Route path=\"/\" element={<HomePage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/posts/:id\" element={<PostPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/posts/:id/edit\" element={<EditorPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/new\" element={<EditorPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/login\" element={<LoginPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"/register\" element={<RegisterPage />} />\n      <Route path=\"*\" element={<NotFoundPage />} />\n    </Routes>\n  );\n}\n","filePath":"/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx"},"output":"Wrote file successfully.","metadata":{"diagnostics":{},"filepath":"/workspace/frontend/src/App.tsx","exists":true,"truncated":false},"title":"frontend/src/App.tsx","time":{"start":1794366317548,"end":1794366317556}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_1c89123e7001Ydx9d4bZ40mUws","sessionID":"ses_e377d0badffet7LSn1dj9cFwue","messageID":"msg_1c890f1c7001yw4MLycQy4t6MQ"}}
